Error [jet.DistinctArithmeticNotAllowed]: `+` is not available between `CelsiusPoint` and `CelsiusPoint`
  --> tests/ui/quantity_point_plus_point.jet:7:12
    |
  7 |     bad :: CelsiusPoint.from_float(1.0) + CelsiusPoint.from_float(2.0)
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Affine points are positions; only point + delta, point - delta, point - point, and delta + delta are defined
 Fix: Subtract two points for a delta, or add a matching Delta to a point
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0127
